function toast(t,kind){kind??=/失败|错误|无效|无法|不存在|超时|中断|过大|上限|尚未|请先|请输入|请选择|不接受|不支持|已改变|已更新，请/.test(t)?'error':'success';const el=$('#toast');el.dataset.kind=kind;el.innerHTML=`<span class="toast-icon">${icon(kind==='error'?'alert':'check')}</span><span>${e(t)}</span>`;el.classList.remove('show');void el.offsetWidth;el.classList.add('show');clearTimeout(toast.timer);toast.timer=setTimeout(()=>el.classList.remove('show'),4200)}
async function api(path,data){const r=await fetch('/api/'+path,{method:data===undefined?'GET':'POST',headers:{Authorization:'Bearer '+token,'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:data===undefined?undefined:JSON.stringify(data),signal:AbortSignal.timeout(20000)});const result=await r.json();if(!r.ok){if(r.status===401&&!$('#login').open)showLogin();throw Error(result.error||'请求失败')}return result}
let appliedPreferencesVersion=-1,settingsQueue=Promise.resolve(),settingsPending=0;
// While a local change is still syncing, an older cloud copy must not overwrite it.
function applyCloudPreferences(){const p=state?.workspaceSettings;if(!p||p.version===appliedPreferencesVersion||settingsPending)return;appliedPreferencesVersion=p.version;applyPreferences(p)}
function applyPreferences(p){if(p.theme!==null&&p.theme!==undefined){theme=p.theme;localStorage.setItem('wb-theme',theme);applyTheme()}if(p.density!==null&&p.density!==undefined){density=p.density;document.body.dataset.density=density;localStorage.setItem('wb-density',density)}if(p.reduceMotion!==null&&p.reduceMotion!==undefined){reduceMotion=p.reduceMotion;document.body.dataset.motion=reduceMotion?'reduced':'normal';localStorage.setItem('wb-reduce-motion',String(reduceMotion))}if(p.fontSize)document.documentElement.style.setProperty('--user-font-size',p.fontSize+'px');if(p.defaultModel){model=p.defaultModel;localStorage.setItem('wb-model',model)}if(p.defaultEffort){effort=p.defaultEffort;localStorage.setItem('wb-effort',effort)}}
// Apply on this device at once, then sync to the cloud in the background.
function changeWorkspaceSettings(changes){applyPreferences(changes);if(state?.workspaceSettings)Object.assign(state.workspaceSettings,changes);render();settingsPending++;const task=async()=>{const current=await api('workspace-settings');await api('workspace-settings',{expected_version:current.settings.version,request_id:crypto.randomUUID(),changes})};settingsQueue=settingsQueue.then(task).catch(err=>toast('已在本机生效，但未能同步到云端：'+err.message,'error')).finally(()=>{if(!--settingsPending)refresh().catch(()=>{})});return Promise.resolve()}
async function refresh(){const before=state?new Map((state.submissions||[]).map(p=>[p.id,p.status])):null;state=await api('state'+(session?'?sessionId='+encodeURIComponent(session.id):''));applyCloudPreferences();if(session)session=state.currentSession||null;const live=new Set(state.activeMediaIds||[]);for(const [id,url] of imageCache)if(!live.has(id)){URL.revokeObjectURL(url);imageCache.delete(id)}render();if(before)for(const p of state.submissions||[])if(['已接收','已发表'].includes(p.status)&&before.get(p.id)!==p.status){celebrate(p);break}}
// A 待判断 item leaves the Today list in one of three ways: decided (with an optional note), snoozed 7 days, or dropped.
let editingDecision=null;
async function resolveDecision(kind){const r=editingDecision,day=d=>new Intl.DateTimeFormat('sv-SE').format(d),status={done:'已决定',drop:'不再需要',snooze:'待判断'}[kind];let lines=r.text.split('\n').filter(l=>!l.startsWith('暂缓至：'));lines=lines.some(l=>l.startsWith('原状态：'))?lines.map(l=>l.startsWith('原状态：')?'原状态：'+status:l):[...lines,'原状态：'+status];
 if(kind==='snooze')lines.push('暂缓至：'+day(new Date(Date.now()+7*864e5)));else{const line=`决定：${$('#decisionText').value.trim()||(kind==='done'?'已处理':'不再需要')}（${day(new Date())}）`,i=lines.findIndex(l=>l.startsWith('决定：'));if(i>=0)lines[i]=line;else lines.push(line)}
 try{await api('edit-record',{id:r.id,version:r.version,text:lines.join('\n')});editingDecision=null;closeDialog('decisionDialog');await refresh();toast(kind==='done'?'已记下决定':kind==='snooze'?'已暂缓 7 天，到期会再出现':'已标记为不再需要')}catch(err){$('#decisionError').textContent=err.message}}
// Acceptance and publication are rare; mark them with a ripple of contour lines and the running count toward the PhD goal.
function celebrate(p){const pub=p.status==='已发表',all=state.submissions||[],list=all.filter(x=>x.status===p.status),year=new Date().getFullYear(),inYear=list.filter(x=>x.id===p.id||String(x.publishedOnlineAt||x.acceptedAt||x.year||'').startsWith(String(year))).length,rest=PHD.goal-all.filter(x=>x.status==='已发表').length;
 setTimeout(()=>toast(`第 ${list.length} 篇${pub?'发表':'接收'} · ${year} 年第 ${inYear} 篇${pub?rest>0?` · 距 ${PHD.goal} 篇还差 ${rest} 篇`:` · ${PHD.goal} 篇的愿望达成`:''}`,'success'),450);
 if(!motionOK())return;const el=document.createElement('div');el.className='ripple-burst';el.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');el.innerHTML=`<svg class="ripple" viewBox="-100 -100 200 200">${'<circle r="98"/>'.repeat(6)}</svg>`;document.body.append(el);setTimeout(()=>el.remove(),3000)}
function title(t,desc=''){return `<h1 class="page-title">${t}</h1>${desc?`<p class="page-intro">${desc}</p>`:''}`}
function pending(){const proposals=state.proposals.filter(p=>p.status==='pending'&&(view()!=='chat'||p.source?.sessionId===session?.id)&&(view()!=='records'||recordFilter==='all'||p.scope===recordFilter));return proposals.map(p=>`<article class="proposal"><div class="proposal-head"><span class="proposal-badge">${icon('sparkles')}待保存</span><span class="small-label">${p.scope==='personal'?'生活记录':p.action==='set_stage'?'项目阶段':'科研记录'}</span></div><p>${e(p.action==='set_stage'?`${state.projects.find(x=>x.id===p.projectId)?.name} → ${p.stage}`:p.text)}</p><small>${e(p.reason)}</small><div class="proposal-actions"><button class="chip" data-dismiss="${p.id}">忽略</button><button class="primary" data-accept="${p.id}">${icon('check')}保存</button></div></article>`).join('')}
// Escaped-first Markdown subset: headings, lists, quotes, fenced code, rules, bold/italic/code/links.
function inline(t){return t.split(/(`[^`\n]+`)/g).map((part,i)=>i%2?`<code>${part.slice(1,-1)}</code>`:part.replace(/\*\*([^*\n]+)\*\*/g,'<strong>$1</strong>').replace(/(^|[^*\w])\*([^*\s][^*\n]*?)\*(?!\*)/g,'$1<em>$2</em>').replace(/\[([^\]\n]+)\]\((https?:\/\/[^\s)]+)\)/g,'<a href="$2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">$1</a>').replace(/\[(\d{1,2})\](?!\()/g,'<sup class="cite">$1</sup>')).join('')}
const blockStart=/^(```|#{1,4}\s|&gt;|\s*[-*+]\s+|\s*\d+[.)]\s+)/;
function formatText(src){const lines=e(src).split('\n');let out='',i=0;while(i<lines.length){const l=lines[i];
 if(/^```/.test(l)){const lang=l.slice(3).trim(),buf=[];i++;while(i<lines.length&&!/^```/.test(lines[i]))buf.push(lines[i++]);i++;out+=`<div class="code-block"><div class="code-head"><span>${lang||'code'}</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" data-copy-code>${icon('copy')}<span>复制</span></button></div><pre><code>${buf.join('\n')}</code></pre></div>`;continue}
 const h=l.match(/^(#{1,4})\s+(.*)$/);if(h){const n=Math.min(h[1].length+2,6);out+=`<h${n}>${inline(h[2])}</h${n}>`;i++;continue}
 if(/^\s*([-*_])(\s*\1){2,}\s*$/.test(l)){out+='<hr>';i++;continue}
 if(/^&gt;/.test(l)){const buf=[];while(i<lines.length&&/^&gt;/.test(lines[i]))buf.push(lines[i++].replace(/^&gt;\s?/,''));out+=`<blockquote>${buf.map(inline).join('<br>')}</blockquote>`;continue}
 if(/^\s*[-*+]\s+/.test(l)){const buf=[];while(i<lines.length&&/^\s*[-*+]\s+/.test(lines[i]))buf.push(lines[i++].replace(/^\s*[-*+]\s+/,''));out+=`<ul>${buf.map(x=>`<li>${inline(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`;continue}
 if(/^\s*\d+[.)]\s+/.test(l)){const start=parseInt(l,10),buf=[];while(i<lines.length&&/^\s*\d+[.)]\s+/.test(lines[i]))buf.push(lines[i++].replace(/^\s*\d+[.)]\s+/,''));out+=`<ol${start>1?` start="${start}"`:''}>${buf.map(x=>`<li>${inline(x)}</li>`).join('')}</ol>`;continue}
 if(!l.trim()){i++;continue}
 const buf=[lines[i++]];while(i<lines.length&&lines[i].trim()&&!blockStart.test(lines[i]))buf.push(lines[i++]);out+=`<p>${buf.map(inline).join('<br>')}</p>`}
 return out}
function sourceList(list){if(!list?.length)return '';return `<div class="message-sources"><span class="sources-label">${icon('search')}来源</span><div class="source-grid">${list.map((x,i)=>{let host='';try{host=new URL(x.url).hostname.replace(/^www\./,'')}catch{}return /^https?:\/\//.test(x.url)?`<a class="source-chip ${x.kind==='paper'?'paper':''}" href="${e(x.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="source-num">${i+1}</span><span class="source-text"><span class="source-title">${e(x.title)}</span><span class="source-host">${x.kind==='paper'?'文献 · ':''}${e(host)}</span></span></a>`:''}).join('')}</div></div>`}
